    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p><span data-math=\"6 \\times {10^5} + 0 \\times {10^4} + 1 \\times {10^3} + 9 \\times {10^2} + 4 \\times {10^1} + 7 \\times {10^0}\"></span></p>\n<p>Remember that any base raised to the exponent 0 is 1.</p>\n<p>Use the order of expressions (PEMDAS), which means</p>\n<p>do the exponents first,</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"6 \\times 100,000 + 0 \\times 10,000 + 1 \\times 1,000 + 9 \\times 100 + 4 \\times 10 + 7 \\times 1\"></span></p>\n<p>then multiplications,</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"600,000 + 0 + 1,000 + 900 + 40 + 7\"></span></p>\n<p>then additions.</p>\n<p>601,947</p>"
    },
    {
